@startuml
[*] --> PowerOn
PowerOn --> [*]
PowerOn --> StartupFailed : problem during startup
StartupFailed --> Idle : stop
Idle --> ReadyToUse : everything is fine during startup
ReadyToUse --> Reset : reset by user
Reset --> Idle : system reset
ReadyToUse --> Activate : activate by user
Activate --> Monitoring : start monitoring
Monitoring --> Alarm : sensor triggered
Alarm --> ContinueMonitoring : false alarm or time ended
ContinueMonitoring --> ReadyToUse : continue monitoring
ReadyToUse --> TurnOff : turn off by user
TurnOff --> Idle : system turned off
Idle --> PasswordEntry : user enters password
PasswordEntry --> ReadyToUse : correct password entered

state Monitoring {
  [*] --> Active
  Active --> Alarm : sensor triggered
  Alarm --> ContinueMonitoring : false alarm or time ended
}

state Alarm {
  [*] --> Triggered
  Triggered --> ContinueMonitoring : false alarm or time ended
}
@enduml
